// The word confession counts as confess.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE confess ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law     ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG confess law

IMPULSE confess 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "confess" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
